component Driver2EDR8259X:
    """Infineon EiceDRIVER 2EDR8259XXUMA1, reinforced isolated dual gate driver, PG-DSO-14 (the DWK outline: positions
    12/13 absent, so its pins 12/13/14 GNDA/OUTA/VDDA sit on footprint pads 14/15/16). Stage 29 (DECISIONS 31; candidate
    25): replaces UCC21550BDWKR (no stock until 2027-06; CMTI 125 V/ns = 1.32x the modelled 95 V/ns edge). CMTI >= 150 V/ns
    static; VIORM 1767 Vpk; 5 A / 9 A; VDD 8.5-21 V (abs max 22 V; rails 17.0 V); VDDI UVLO on <= 2.95 V; VINH <= 2.36 V.
    STP/DTC pin: tdt = 10 x R[kohm] (Table 19 spread +-15 %). DIS is active high with an internal PULL-DOWN (open =
    enabled), the opposite of the UCC21550's pull-up: R73 / R76 (10 k to V3V3) alone hold an open DIS disabled.
    Infineon 2EDR8259H/X datasheet Rev 1.7 (2026-04-09); 11-candidates/c25-driver."""
    designator_prefix = "U"
    footprint = "lib:SOIC16W_Isolated"
    mpn = "2EDR8259XXUMA1"
    manufacturer = "Infineon"
    signal INA ~ pin 1
    signal INB ~ pin 2
    signal VCCI_1 ~ pin 3
    signal GNDI ~ pin 4
    signal DIS ~ pin 5
    signal DT ~ pin 6
    signal NC_7 ~ pin 7
    signal VCCI_2 ~ pin 8
    signal VSSB ~ pin 9
    signal OUTB ~ pin 10
    signal VDDB ~ pin 11
    signal VSSA ~ pin 14
    signal OUTA ~ pin 15
    signal VDDA ~ pin 16

