component ResB32643B:
    """TDK B32643B8104J000 (stage 49, candidate 34 / DECISIONS 68): 0.10 uF +-5 % 2000 Vdc / 500 Vac MMKP
    "High frequency", 22.5 mm radial, AEC-Q200D. B3264*B data sheet (6/26): e 22.5 +-0.4 mm, d1 0.8 +-0.05 mm (p.2);
    maximum body w x h x l 14.5 x 29.5 x 26.5 mm, IRMS,max 8.3 A at 85 C / 100 kHz for dT <= 15 C, ESR_typ 8 mOhm,
    ESL_typ 11 nH, untaped MOQ 2080 (p.11); Top,max 125 C case (p.2, p.12); dV/dt 3800 V/us (p.13). Five in parallel
    keep the 0.50 uF bank; replaces B32654A1104J000 (1600 Vdc, P27.5), which sits at TDK's self-heating limit in the
    0.5 mm column (bank28-air). Not stocked at JLC: an owner pre-order / consigned line (28 weeks, MOQ 2080)."""
